<%- include('partials/head') %>
    <div class="container rules-wrapper">
        <h2 class="rules-h2">You will receive a Master Word.</h2>
        
        <p class="rules-p">
            Your goal is to find as many valid words as possible hidden inside it.
        </p>

        <h3 class="rules-h3">Rules:</h3>
        <ul class="rules-ul">
            <li>Letters must appear in the same order as the master word.</li>
            <li>Letters do not need to be consecutive.</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="rules-h3">Scoring System:</h3>
        <ul class="rules-ul">
            <li><strong>Word Length:</strong> You earn 10 base points for every letter in a valid word. Longer words give more points!</li>
            <li><strong>Combo Bonus:</strong> Guessing valid words in a row builds your combo streak for massive bonuses:
                <ul>
                    <li>Combo 1+: +10 points</li>
                    <li>Combo 3+: +30 points</li>
                    <li>Combo 5+: +50 points</li>
                    <li>Combo 7+: +80 points</li>
                </ul>
            </li>
            <li><strong>Penalties:</strong> Guessing an <strong>invalid word</strong> costs you 20 points and resets your combo. Guessing a <strong>duplicate word</strong> costs you 10 points.</li>
        </ul>

        <p class="rules-p-bottom">
            In multiplayer mode, players compete to find the most words before the timer ends.
        </p>

        <div class="text-center">
            <a href="/menu" class="btn">Back to Menu</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>